'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 18''' was the eighteenth and final block show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on October 9, 2026 at the Toyozawa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Toyozawa]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 9 matches.

The night is remembered for the family closing the block — [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]] defeating [[Tadayoshi Ishida]] to win Block B and book the family's place in the Aizawa Dome, and [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] stopping the slide with a win that could not save his tournament.

